icturesque views. The Valley Phase 2 Community allows you to be part of an established community with a reputable developer while also providing access to upcoming amenities catered towards an active lifestyle.</p><p>With versatile townhouses, you have the opportunity to invest early and watch your property value rise over the years in this desirable neighborhood. The Valley Phase 2 Feature &amp; Amenities offer everything you need for a fulfilling lifestyle.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/the_valley_ph2_feat_17d85dda6b.jpg","hash":"the_valley_ph2_feat_17d85dda6b","name":"The Valley Phase 2"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/the_valley_ph2_banner_eb0459d099.jpg","hash":"the_valley_ph2_banner_eb0459d099","name":"The Valley Phase 2"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Valley_Phase_2_Townhouses_by_Emaar_Properties_6425ebfbb9.jpg","hash":"The_Valley_Phase_2_Townhouses_by_Emaar_Properties_6425ebfbb9","name":"The Valley Phase 2 Townhouses by Emaar Properties"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Valley_Phase_2_Townhouses_by_Emaar_Properties_ec82f0974b.jpg","hash":"The_Valley_Phase_2_Townhouses_by_Emaar_Properties_ec82f0974b","name":"The Valley Phase 2 Townhouses by Emaar Properties"}],"images":[{"id":12625,"ext":".jpg","url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/null/images/i/the_valley_ph2_feat_17d85dda6b.jpg","hash":"the_valley_ph2_feat_17d85dda6b","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"The Valley Phase 2","size":299.72,"width":538,"height":323,"srcUrl":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/the_valley_ph2_feat_17d85dda6b.jpg","caption":null,"formats":{"thumbnail":{"ext":".jpg","url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/thumbnail_the_valley_ph2_feat_17d85dda6b.jpg","hash":"thumbnail_the_valley_ph2_feat_17d85dda6b","mime":"image