ase 2 by Emaar.</li><li><strong>Easy Access to Dubai Al Ain Road:</strong> Conveniently located with easy access to Dubai Al Ain Road.</li><li><strong>Expansive, Efficient Designs:</strong> Live in spacious, efficiently designed homes in The Valley Phase 2 by Emaar.</li><li><strong>Largest Plot Sizes:</strong> Invest in the largest plots for 3 &amp; 4 bedroom townhouses in the market.</li><li><strong>Safe and Secure Investment:</strong> Build on the success of The Valley Phase 1 for a secure investment.</li><li><strong>Relaxed 80/20 Payment Plan:</strong> Pay 20% annually with the 80/20 payment plan.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":932,"cta":{"id":1560,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Location_fb31b90485.jpg","hash":"Location_fb31b90485","name":"Milos Residences Location PDF"},"style":null,"title":"Perfectly Positioned at The Valley Phase 2","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>The Valley offers exceptional connectivity via Jebel Ali Lahbab Road, starting at the Sheikh Zayed Road Interchange and extending to Emirates Road. This vital corridor promotes rapid development by linking key areas such as Jebel Ali Industrial Area, JAFZA, Dubai South, DIP, and culminating at the Expo 2020 site. The Valley Phase 2 Project by Emaar Properties, located in the heart of Dubai, is not just a residential area but a thriving community worth investing in. With its picturesque landscapes, premium amenities, and strategic location, living in The Valley Phase 2 by Emaar offers an unparalleled lifestyle in Dubai.</p><ul><li>05 Minutes to Rugby Sevens Stadium</li><li>08 Minutes to Dubai Outlet Mall</li><li>25 Minutes to Burj Khalifa &amp; Dubai Mall</li><li>25 Minutes to Dubai Int'l Airport</li></ul>","design_title"